                            <comment id="16080296" author="amalykh" created="Mon, 10 Jul 2017 13:02:38 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Fixed tests by changing test criterion from cache::containsKeys/!cache::containsKeys to cache::invoke(k, lambda calculating size of corresponding row) should give row size for all rows when matrix is expected to be present in cache and cache::invoke(k, lambda getting row) should return for all rows null when matrix is not expected to be in the cache.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
